sVScribd may also use Your Personal Information to deliver a specific program or service to You, when You enroll to receive the program or service.
p13
I1
sVScribd may also provide Personal Information to business partners with whom We may jointly offer products or services, or whose products or services We believe may be of interest to You.
p14
I1
sVScribd may collect Personal Information to enable You to use online social media resources offered either by Scribd or a Third Party Service.
p15
I1
sVScribd may collect information about You from Third Parties to supplement the information that You provide.
p16
I1
sVSome Third Parties may choose to share their users\u2019 Personal Information with Scribd; that sharing is governed by that company\u2019s privacy policy, not this Privacy Policy.
p17
I1
sVIf Scribd intends to use this Personal Information for any other purpose, Scribd will provide the Data Subject with an opportunity to opt-out of such uses.
p18
I2
sVScribd may share Personal Information with Third Parties that We have retained to perform services on Our behalf including (i) provision of IT and related services; (ii) provision of information and services You have requested; (iii) payment processing; and (iv) customer service activities.
p19
I1
sVAccordingly, Scribd provides this policy (\u201cPrivacy Policy\u201d) to inform You about Our online information practices, the kinds of information that We collect, and how We intend to use and share that information (\u201cProcessing\u201d).
p20
I1
sVScribd may use Your Personal Information to create non-identifiable anonymous information that We may use, alone or in the aggregate, along with information obtained from other sources, in order to help Us to optimally deliver Our existing products and services or develop new products, processes and services.
p21
I1
sVScribd may use Your Personal Information and other information about You to create and analyze anonymized and aggregated information.
p22
I1
sVYou may receive periodic emails, newsletters, mailings or phone calls from Us with information on Scribd or Our business partners\u2019 products and services or any upcoming special offers/events that We believe may be of interest whenever You provide Us with Personal Information, or whenever we obtain your Personal Information from Third Parties.
p23
I3
sVScribd may share Personal Information with Our business partners, and affiliates for Our and Our affiliates\u2019 internal business purposes, or to provide You with a product or service that You have requested.
p24
I1
sVCompanies unrelated to Scribd occasionally provide interactive resources that enable You to collaborate and share information with others.
p25
I1
sVCalifornia law entitles California residents to ask Us for a notice describing what categories of Personal Information We collect, from what sources, for what purpose and with whom Scribd shares such information.
p26
I1
sVWe may disclose information about You:
p27
I1
sVScribd collects Personal Information from current, prospective and former employees, their contacts (in case of a medical emergency), and their beneficiaries as necessary (\u201cHuman Resources Data\u201d).
p28
I1
sVWe may share this information within Scribd and with Third Parties for Our or their purposes in an anonymized or aggregated form that is designed to prevent anyone from identifying You.
p29
I1
sVScribd may use such information to enhance these tools, to develop new tools, for quality improvement and as otherwise described in this Privacy Policy or in other notices Scribd provides.
p30
I1
sVScribd may use the Personal Information about You to provide You information that You may request (such as information about a product or service We are offering).
p31
I1
sVAnonymized or aggregated information is generally not considered to be Personal Information, and Scribd may use such information in a number of ways, including research, internal analysis, analytics and any other legally permissible purposes.
p32
I1
sVScribd may use the Personal Information about You to provide You with materials about offers, products, and services that We offer, including new contents, products, Sites, Apps, or services.
p33
I1
sVScribd may use the Personal Information about You in order to prevent fraud and to protect the accuracy and integrity of financial transactions made throughout the Sites and Apps.
p34
I1
sVIf You do not wish Us to use Your Personal Information for marketing purposes, You may contact Us
p35
I1
sVIf You tell Us to do so, Scribd will share limited amounts of information with the Third Party in order to enable the feature You choose.
p36
I1
sVWith regard to Personal Information that Scribd receives in connection with the employment relationship, Scribd will use such Personal Information only for employment-related purposes as more fully described in section 2.5 above.
p37
I1
sVWe endeavor to collect information that is relevant only for the purposes of Processing as described in this policy and its related policies as noted in Section 1.0.
p38
I1
sVScribd may use Personal Information for other purposes for which We have a legitimate interest, such as direct marketing, individual or market research, or any other purpose disclosed to You at the time You provide Personal Information or else with Your consent.
