p47
I1
sVPlease carefully consider what Personal Information You share with others when using Third Party services.
p48
I1
sVScribd may use the Personal Information about You for its administrative purposes, including, without limitation, to: (a) measure interest in Scribd\u2019s Sites, Apps, programs or services; (b) perform internal quality control; (c) verify identity; (d) send communications regarding the Sites, Apps, programs, services, Your account, or any changes to any Scribd policy or terms of service; (e) process payments; (f) prevent potentially prohibited or illegal activities; and (g) enforce Our General Terms of Use.
